## TargetCo Valuation Range (Implied)

TargetCo FY25 ARR: $46.2M  
TargetCo FY25 EBITDA (adj.): $7.8M  
TargetCo ARR growth: 27.4%  
TargetCo NRR: 118%

| Multiple Basis | Comp Range | Implied EV Low | Implied EV High |
|---------------|-----------|---------------|----------------|
| EV/ARR | 6.3x – 7.9x | $291M | $365M |
| EV/EBITDA | 39.5x – 48.5x | $308M | $378M |

**Blended midpoint range: $300M – $370M EV**

## Adjustments

- Premium for ARR growth > comp median (+27.4% vs. 29% median): ~neutral
- Discount for customer concentration risk (31% top-5): -5% to -8%
- Premium for NRR above comp median (118% vs. 116%): +2% to +3%
- IP encumbrance discount if ML model issue unresolved: -3% to -5%

**Risk-adjusted range: $285M – $360M EV**
